  "notice": "Experimental audio-only GStreamer runtime from ready-built Ubuntu and conda-forge packages. FFmpeg 8.1.2 LGPL v3 native SOs come from the ordinary (non-GPL) JavaCPP Presets artifact in Maven Central; neither JavaCPP classes nor its JNI SOs are shipped or used. Exact archives and SHA256 are in runtime-manifest.json. FFmpeg avcodec_license reports LGPL version 3 or later; GPL and nonfree codecs are disabled. Individual package copyrights, upstream FFmpeg dependency notices and full GNU licenses are adjacent. Libraries remain separate and replaceable. No C/C++ source compilation occurs. Source/build provenance: Ubuntu source packages for the recorded package versions; conda-forge/gst-libav-feedstock, glib-feedstock, libiconv-feedstock; https://github.com/bytedeco/javacpp-presets/tree/1.5.14/ffmpeg contains pinned build versions and patches. FFmpeg source is 8.1.2, https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-8.1.2.tar.xz. The complete Presets source archive is pinned in this manifest. GTK and sufficiently new GLib/libdrm are shared with the operating system to avoid preloading an older graphics foundation.",
